1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,050
Your light was on.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,630
I leave it on.

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,780
Why.

4
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:07,360
So you'd know which one's mine.

5
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:09,560
I know which one's yours.

6
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:10,640
Which.

7
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:11,820
Forty.

8
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,620
You count them.

9
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:15,220
Every night.

10
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,800
How many are lit.

11
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:18,180
Sixty-two.

12
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:19,480
And yours.

13
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,760
Mine's not on the list.

14
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:25,160
Ninety-one flats. Yours is the dark one.
